{"id": "o1", "act": "precize", "body": "Fiktiv person A svarar på frågan om \"och\": läsart (b). Utbildningen som helhet ska vila på de två tillsammans; beprövad erfarenhet kan bära det som forskningen inte täcker. Skäl: l2.", "author": "A (fiktiv skoljurist)", "kind": "person", "value": null, "object": null, "absent": null, "sources": [], "rests": ["A (fiktiv skoljurist):l2", "g1 (for A):q1"], "answers": [{"ref": "g1 (for A):a1", "disputes": false, "meets": null, "hash": "02c9c768c714547022708e8677f63b203a10e199b92e12fcf345b42748729ace"}, {"ref": "g2 (for A):a1", "disputes": false, "meets": null, "hash": "135c7b8d978de3e247f1c48b182a3b9c1275be57f91729021deee5864a30affe"}], "about": null, "narrows": null, "withdraws": null, "reason": null, "procedure": null, "via": null, "log": "A (fiktiv skoljurist)", "prev": "364f4c3ec818aa69f49374b08238dda1a1061a5d3cb6cfe3193460940a48e6ba", "rest_hashes": ["e1e80cd01977fb24393e795c343bfd75c305c50647b21bbf078d2eeaa4d97e25", "825761e28b0794d2a59f8f9c91e8fd8a847d09e569bfd12711a701dc07c8e688"], "hash": "556489e140711f3482bd708f8b196150bb7d3b9e64588d5c9f0bc46ff2ddbf74", "sig": "6a85f1680128da96d7b5644ad24e739fb65e1e453813c12e11af28c69c32ee959593b614aa87de322cd319eb375e3c1e493e40449b0abc20784fe5be2a45c905"}
{"id": "vd1", "act": "verdict", "body": "Fiktiv person A: granskningens utslag. Inget av de fem ännu, eftersom inget fall finns. Ramen är 1b, skenbar enighet: lagstiftaren själv håller tre läsarter under samma ord (l1), och under (b) behöver de aldrig ställas mot varandra. Jag ansluter mig till g1:vd1.", "author": "A (fiktiv skoljurist)", "kind": "person", "value": "none, frame 1b", "object": "g1 (for A):q1", "absent": null, "sources": [], "rests": ["g1 (for A):vd1", "A (fiktiv skoljurist):l1", "A (fiktiv skoljurist):h1", "A (fiktiv skoljurist):h2", "A (fiktiv skoljurist):h3", "A (fiktiv skoljurist):o1"], "answers": [], "about": null, "narrows": null, "withdraws": null, "reason": null, "procedure": null, "via": null, "log": "A (fiktiv skoljurist)", "prev": "556489e140711f3482bd708f8b196150bb7d3b9e64588d5c9f0bc46ff2ddbf74", "rest_hashes": ["58645e651b0d716c1dc7c9f76f791a825de719d75de105e879fb34b4a22669cf", "2320751c3689be9e355a87a9fbf168ab425dadafd0603cd6741250711022e5d4", "b923d49554685913352b5fcfb66caffcff49d381c7e9453c488214c5c12eb7e9", "0b2857bd82d34348f039ae6db0bb13c1d48efc76fd4e6729b4377f073e32154c", "364f4c3ec818aa69f49374b08238dda1a1061a5d3cb6cfe3193460940a48e6ba", "556489e140711f3482bd708f8b196150bb7d3b9e64588d5c9f0bc46ff2ddbf74"], "hash": "a570df40828d89ce8f4d18dbf755a328420cc9aa3f4a0795fd9e7f7909995113", "sig": "28e38a50fd4d622f67a47b4b440b261513fd9840eb512d75d651be62b1870acb46be6cb21b790b1e6a24689ab2f91e1fd99d47a3c23b5c486bc468c3d57d7207"}
